          "status": "not_applicable",
          "reason": "Under T1–T3 and the equal-state reversible split in [[def-tdmath-thermal-contact-hypotheses]], if $x\\sim_T y$ then $s x\\sim_T t y$ for every $s,t>0$. Boundary empty: The item makes no empty boundary claim; this case does not apply to its stated result.",
