        "notes": "Checked strict order of mixture parameters by signed differences and inverse positive scaling. For 0<lambda<1, reversible scaled equilibrium joins compare in one simple join domain; endpoints use the given strip. The nonempty bounded lower cut has supremum by real completeness. Deterministic tail sequences s±1/n give each attained comparison by stability; s=0 and s=1 are excluded by strict endpoint comparisons. Unique reference coordinate follows by strict reference order. No CH is assumed for compounds before this deduction."
