          "reason": "Under [[def-tdmath-forward-sector-hypotheses]], the sectors are nested: if $y\\in A_x$, then $A_y\\subseteq A_x$; equality holds when $y\\in\\partial A_x$, and $A_y\\subset\\operatorname{int}_{\\Gamma_i}A_x$ when $y\\in\\operatorname{int}_{\\Gamma_i}A_x$. Boundary empty: The item makes no empty boundary claim; this case does not apply to its stated result.",
